<title>HUNGARY: Bayernwerk sees 96 profit above plan.</title>
<headline>Bayernwerk sees 96 profit above plan.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>German electricity company Bayernwerk AG, part of the Viag diversified group, said on Thursday it expected its 1996 profit to be slightly better than planned.</p>
<p>&quot;The profit will probably be a little better than planned at the end of 1995/start of 1996,&quot; Bayernwerk management board member Manfred Klis said at a news conference in Budapest.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
